  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
</head>
<body class="lp-body">

  <header class="lp-nav">
    <div class="lp-nav-inner">
      <a href="/" class="lp-brand">
        <span class="brand-mark">xrepu</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="lp-nav-links">
        <a href="/login">Log in</a>
        <a href="/signup" class="btn lp-nav-cta">Get Started</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="lp-hero">
    <div class="lp-hero-inner">
      <span class="lp-eyebrow">Reputation. Operations. Replies.</span>
      <h1>Your reputation, run like a business.</h1>
      <p class="lp-hero-sub">
        xrepu drafts a ready-to-send reply for every new Google review in seconds — then turns the
        patterns behind those reviews into an operator's report: what's actually wrong, what it's
        costing you, and what to fix first.
      </p>
      <div class="lp-hero-actions">
        <a href="/signup" class="btn lp-cta">Get Started — $129/mo</a>
        <a href="#how" class="lp-cta-ghost">See how it works</a>
      </div>
      <p class="lp-hero-note">No long-term contract. Cancel anytime from your dashboard.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lp-mock">
      <div class="lp-mock-row">
        <span class="lp-mock-chip">★★★★☆ — slow service</span>
        <span class="lp-mock-chip">★★★★★ — great staff</span>
        <span class="lp-mock-chip">★★★☆☆ — long wait</span>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-mock-card">
        <div class="lp-mock-top">
          <span class="lp-mock-name">Sarah M.</span>
          <span class="lp-mock-stars">★★★★★</span>
        </div>
        <p class="lp-mock-text">"Amazing service, the staff were incredibly helpful and the food was perfect!"</p>
        <div class="lp-mock-reply">
          <span class="lp-mock-reply-label">AI-drafted reply</span>
          <p>Thank you so much, Sarah! We're thrilled you had a great experience and can't wait to welcome you back.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lp-pillars">
    <div class="lp-pillar">
      <span class="lp-pillar-n">01</span>
      <h3>Reputation</h3>
      <p>Every review, in every language, tracked in one place — with the recurring patterns pulled out for you automatically.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-pillar">
      <span class="lp-pillar-n">02</span>
      <h3>Operations</h3>
      <p>An executive dashboard that prices each recurring complaint, compares branches, and flags a rating drop before it becomes a crisis.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-pillar">
      <span class="lp-pillar-n">03</span>
      <h3>Replies</h3>
      <p>A professional, on-brand reply drafted the moment a review lands — reviewed by you, or auto-published when it's safe to.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lp-features">
    <div class="lp-section-head">
      <span class="lp-kicker">What you get</span>
      <h2>Everything you need to run your reputation like an operator.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-feature-grid">
      <div class="lp-feature">
        <h4>AI-drafted replies</h4>
        <p>Every new review gets a ready-to-send reply in seconds, in the reviewer's own language and your chosen tone.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-feature">
        <h4>Smart auto-publish</h4>
        <p>Safe, positive reviews publish their replies instantly. Anything with doubt waits for your review.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-feature">
        <h4>Cost of each problem</h4>
        <p>Recurring complaints converted into an estimated financial impact, so you know what's worth fixing first.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-feature">
        <h4>Early warning</h4>
        <p>Get flagged the moment a complaint pattern starts climbing — before it turns into a wave of bad reviews.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-feature">
        <h4>Branch comparison</h4>
        <p>See which location is pulling ahead, which is falling behind, and why — on a single screen.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-feature">
        <h4>Weekly operator report</h4>
        <p>Problem, likely cause, financial impact, suggested action — written in plain language, delivered to your inbox.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-feature">
        <h4>Competitor analysis</h4>
        <p>Look up any competitor by name and see their strengths and weaknesses from their own public reviews.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-feature">
        <h4>Ask your data</h4>
        <p>A built-in assistant that answers questions about your own performance — grounded in your real numbers only.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-feature">
        <h4>QR review requests</h4>
        <p>A ready-made QR code and link that send happy customers straight to your Google review page.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lp-how" id="how">
    <div class="lp-section-head lp-section-head-light">
      <span class="lp-kicker">How it works</span>
      <h2>Three steps. You see results from day one.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-steps">
      <div class="lp-step">
        <span class="lp-step-n">1</span>
        <h4>Connect your Google Business Profile</h4>
        <p>A direct, two-minute connection. Add more than one location whenever you're ready.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-step">
        <span class="lp-step-n">2</span>
        <h4>Every new review gets a ready reply</h4>
        <p>In the customer's own language, in a tone you choose. Review, edit, or approve with one click.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="lp-step">
        <span class="lp-step-n">3</span>
        <h4>Your operator's report writes itself</h4>
        <p>Recurring causes, financial impact, and a suggested action — weekly, without you asking for it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="lp-pricing">
    <div class="lp-section-head">
      <span class="lp-kicker">Pricing</span>
      <h2>One plan. Everything included.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-price-card">
      <div class="lp-price">$129<span>/ month / business</span></div>
      <ul>
        <li>Unlimited reviews and AI-drafted replies</li>
        <li>Full executive dashboard and weekly operator report</li>
        <li>Competitor analysis, photo analysis, branch comparison</li>
        <li>Cancel anytime</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/signup" class="btn lp-cta full">Get Started</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="lp-footer">
    <span class="brand-mark brand-mark-sm">xrepu</span>
    <p class="lp-footer-tagline">Reputation management, built for operators.</p>
    <p class="lp-footer-links">
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>
    </p>
